  <div class="space-y-4">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 text-[16px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Accounting and compliance</p>
      <p class="text-[14px] text-[#6B7280]">When 100% accuracy is required and rules are clearly defined. AI adds risk without benefit.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 text-[16px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Simple CRUD applications</p>
      <p class="text-[14px] text-[#6B7280]">Basic data entry, inventory tracking, scheduling. Traditional software is simpler and cheaper.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 text-[16px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Low data volume</p>
      <p class="text-[14px] text-[#6B7280]">When you have hundreds, not thousands, of records. AI needs data to learn patterns.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

